Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 08:59:32 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Bundle SQL highlighting in RedVim

SELECT some colors, FROM the binary bright;
Prepared statements join the opening night.
The parser trips; a few lost words recover,
While tests inspect each hue beneath the cover.
